aNMJ-morph+ License and Attribution

This repository is a modified distribution of aNMJ-morph and its supporting material.

Original material
-----------------
The original aNMJ-morph macro and supporting dataset were created by Minty, Hoppen, Boehm, and colleagues at the University of Edinburgh and distributed through Edinburgh DataShare:

https://doi.org/10.7488/ds/2625

The original material is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).

aNMJ-morph+ adaptation and modifications
----------------------------------------
The aNMJ-morph+ adaptation, modifications, and additions in this repository are authored by Abdullah Alzeiby:

https://github.com/alzeiby/aNMJ-morph-plus

Unless otherwise noted, those modifications and additions are also made available under CC BY 4.0.

